'''Magnetic tongs''' were a tool used by [[the Armorer]] to forge [[Mandalorian]] [[Mandalorian armor|armor]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|amorer-s-equipment|Armorer's equipment}}</ref> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate}}</ref> the Armorer used it within her [[Armorer's workshop|workshop]] inside the [[Nevarro Mandalorian covert|Mandalorian covert]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]]<ref name="Star Wars Book">''[[The Star Wars Book]]''</ref> [[planet]] [[Nevarro]] to forge [[Din Djarin's armor]].<ref name="The Sin" /> Later, she used it within the [[Mandalorian covert|covert]] on [[Glavis Ringworld]] to reforge a [[beskar spear]] to [[Grogu's chainmail shirt]]. She also used it to spar with [[Din Djarin]], while she trained him to use the [[Darksaber]], as the tool was able to repel strikes from the [[lightsaber]].<ref name="Return of the Mandalorian">{{BOBF|Chapter 5: Return of the Mandalorian}}</ref>
